  "_approach": "Tom arpeggio groove: high, mid and low toms tuned to the key play a descending 16th figure on the a-of-1 / and-of-2 / a-of-2 that repeats each half bar (the '3 tom grooves' approach), over kick 4/4, tight clap and offbeat open hats. Bar 2 adds an extra pass. Reference: ARTBAT 'Return To Oz' (Monolink remix), Stephan Bodzin. (re-voiced for the Vermona DRM1 MKIII's 8 channels)",
